QuestGuidance.Register("es",145,{
[4609]="7002439F\n1\tEntregar las vainas de espada resistentes a Frideric el Anciano en Ost Guruth\030Recolecta vainas de espada resistentes (total: 10)\tHas aceptado una tarea de Frideric el Anciano para conseguir vainas de espada resistentes de las criaturas inteligentes de las Tierras Solitarias. Puedes encontrar a Frideric el Anciano en Ost Guruth.\n",
[4610]="70016B2D\n1\tAnima a la araña escapada a regresar a su jaula\tLa araña de Klintur se encuentra al noroeste del Refugio Sombrío. La araña de Klintur sigue escapándose de su jaula. Te pidió que la encontraras y la 'animaras' a regresar, para que no traiga a toda una camada para liberar a las demás.\n2\tHabla con Klintur en el Refugio Sombrío\tKlintur se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al este de las jaulas de arañas. Klintur estará contento de saber que 'animaste' a la araña a regresar a su jaula.\n",
[4611]="7005FFA6\n1\tDefeat shadow-grims at Eiglinn\t\n2\tDefeat shadow-grims at Eiglinn (total: 8)\tShadow-grims can be found at Eiglinn in Câr Bronach. Summoned forth from the remnants of the Iron Crown's sorcery, shadow-grims roam the tainted lake of Eiglinn.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many shadow-grims at Eiglinn.\n",
[4612]="700661F6\n1\tTalk to Borhador\tArvaethor says his father is currently enjoying the view at Eilendoth and would enjoy your company once more. Talk to Borhador at Eilendoth.\n2\tLook at southern Ringló Vale from the top of the stairs\030Find a good place to look at southern Ringló Vale\030Look at Ethring\030Find a good place to look at Ethring\tBorhador asked you to to look upon Ringló Vale now that the dawnless day has passed. Look out at Ringlo Vale.\n3\tTalk to Borhador\tYou have looked upon Ringló Vale as Borhador asked, and should return to him with your thoughts. Talk to Borhador.\n",
