[4617]="70070281\n1\tDefeat Ratúlko the Bloody\030Defeat Dark Priestess Barkhuráni\030Defeat Thothril the Entangler\tThe palace has fallen under the control of the Thardúth, Thothril the Entangler. You should face the threats within and triumph over evil.\n",
