[4621]="7006EEDD\n1\tDerrota a los guerreros de Ekhamâti (total: 8)\030Derrota a los centinelas de Ekhamâti (total: 6)\030Defeat Ekhamâti champions (total: 3)\030Tend to wounded Subuzûri (total: 6)\tDefeat Ekhamâti forces around you and tend to the wounded Subuzûri in Nisigurûm.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Nisigurûm\tReturn to Mizâdi on the battlefield outside Nisigurûm in southern Imhûlar.\n",
[4622]="7003A41B\n1\tBring the letter to Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farm-house. You should bring the letter to Herubrand.\n2\tTalk to Gifemund\tGifemund is in the ore refinery building within Woodhurst, near the centre of the city. Herubrand told you to insinuate yourself into the good graces of Gifemund in order to learn what he has planned.\n3\tTalk to the mine overseer\tThe overseer is at Wid Isernore, just outside of Woodhurst. Gifemund told you to speak with the overseer of his mine and learn how you might help there.\n4\tRecoge mineral (total: 4)\tWid Isernore is filled with ore-bearing stone. The overseer asked that you gather ore for him.\n5\tTalk to the mine overseer\tThe mine overseer is at Wid Isernore. The ore you gathered should be returned to the mine overseer.\n",
[4623]="70007B8F\n1\tDerrota a la hiladora de telarañas\030Derrota a la trampera de telarañas\030Derrota a la tejedora de telarañas\tLas ancianas de la prole de arañas se encuentran en Amon Ros, al oeste de Ost Guruth. Tortwil te pidió un favor: que fueras a Amon Ros y mataras a las ancianas de la prole de arañas.\n2\tHabla con Tortwil en Ost Guruth\tTortwil espera tu regreso en Ost Guruth, al este de Amon Ros. Tortwil se alegrará de saber de tu victoria contra las ancianas arañas de Amon Ros.\n",
[4624]="70058E25\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[4625]="70058E3D\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[4626]="70058784\n1\tDeliver five Elderslade supply packs to the Elderslade Rewards Quartermaster\tThe crafting recipes for Elderslade supply packs can be bartered for from the Elderslade Rewards Quartermaster. The Elderslade Rewards Quartermaster has asked you to bring them several Elderslade supply packs.\n",
[4627]="700589A5\n1\tEntregar las garras ennegrecidas en un buzón de recogida\030Recoger garras ennegrecidas (total: 10)\tHas aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras ennegrecidas.\n",
